# <type>[optional scope]: <description>
# [optional body]
# [optional footer(s)]
#
# Imperative Mood: "add plugin" not "added plugin"!
# "If applied, this commit will <message>"
#
# TYPES:
# - fix:       bug fix
# - feat:      new feature or plugin
# - docs:      documentation changes
# - perf:      performance improvements
# - test:      adding or fixing tests
# - chore:     maintenance tasks, builds, or tooling changes
# - style:     code style changes (formatting, whitespace, no code change)
# - refactor:  code changes that neither fix a bug nor add a feature
#
# SCOPES:
# - navigation
# - manager
# - options
# - keymaps
# - console
# - editor
# - docs
# - lsp
# - git
# - ai
# - ui
# - fun
#
# EXAMPLE:
#
# feat(lsp): add support for rust-analyzer
#
# Integrated rust-tools.nvim for enhanced Rust language
# features, including inlay hints and hover actions.
#
# Fixes #42
# BREAKING CHANGE: updated LSP config requires Neovim 0.8+
#
# via: https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/
